      },
      "provenance:relationshipType": "copied",
      "provenance:contribution": "The library color filter composes React Aria color area and hue-slider behavior\n([Adobe, n.d.-a](./REFERENCES.md#react-spectrum-adobe-com-react-aria)) with\nReact Stately color state\n([Adobe, n.d.-b](./REFERENCES.md#react-spectrum-adobe-com-react-stately)).\nThe compact gradient-first layout, always-visible controls, and vertical hue track\nretain those primitives. This is independent React code, not copied example code.",
