      "provenance:relationshipType": "consulted",
      "provenance:contribution": "The task graph follows guidance from [Turborepo (n.d.-a)](./REFERENCES.md#turborepo-configuring-tasks), [Turborepo (n.d.-c)](./REFERENCES.md#turborepo-package-configurations), and [Turborepo (n.d.-d)](./REFERENCES.md#turborepo-package-task-graphs). GitHub Actions uses the OIDC flow from [Turborepo (n.d.-b)](./REFERENCES.md#turborepo-github-actions) through the short-lived credential action from [Vercel (n.d.-l)](./REFERENCES.md#github-vercel-setup-turborepo-remote-cache). Vercel documents external CI authentication ([Vercel, n.d.-k](./REFERENCES.md#vercel-external-remote-cache)) and free fair-use availability ([Vercel, 2024](./REFERENCES.md#vercel-free-remote-cache)).",
