      },
      "provenance:relationshipType": "copied",
      "provenance:contribution": "The processing-status review used Basecamp's export status\n([Mobbin, n.d.-m](./REFERENCES.md#mobbin-basecamp-export-processing)), Mercor's\nUploaded / Processing / Results stages\n([Mobbin, n.d.-n](./REFERENCES.md#mobbin-mercor-connection-processing)), and\nZillow's document-generation checklist\n([Mobbin, n.d.-o](./REFERENCES.md#mobbin-zillow-document-processing)).\nThe proposed direction for Pond is a compact status headline, a breakdown of active\nprocessing types, and a separate explanation of when processing pauses. Mercor's\nsequential stages are a hierarchy reference; Pond's enrichments can run independently.\nBasecamp's background-completion promise does not apply to Pond's hidden-window pause.\nThese are visual research references, with original designs by Basecamp, Mercor,\nand Zillow. Screenshot reuse terms are unknown; no code or screen assets were copied.",
      "provenance:target": [
