      },
      "prov:influencer": {
        "@id": "source:eagle-4-20260401"
      },
      "provenance:relationshipType": "adapted",
      "provenance:contribution": "Pond's save dialog now adapts the Collect window's split layout, compact preview,\ninline rating, multiline notes, tag chips, and searchable folder hierarchy with\nrecent destinations. The implementation uses Pond's React components, tag menu,\ntheme tokens, and existing screenshot persistence contract. Folder selection\nstays staged until the explicit Save Screenshot action; this differs from\nEagle's usual destination-click save. Folder creation uses Pond's existing\noperation. Multiple destinations and in-dialog Library switching are not part\nof this adaptation. The interactive local comparison renders the current Pond\ncomponent beside the extracted Eagle interface with synthetic data; native\ncapture and persistence are simulated in that preview. This is independent\ndesign adaptation of [Eagle (2026)](./REFERENCES.md#eagle-4-20260401), with\nno Eagle application code or assets shipped. UI reuse terms remain unknown.",
      "provenance:target": [
        {
          "@id": "target:area%3Ainfluence%2Feagle-parity-baselines"
        }
      ],
      "provenance:confidence": "unknown",
      "prov:generatedAtTime": "2026-09-24"
    },
    {
      "@id": "influence:eagle-4-20260401-influence-eagle-parity-baselines-4",
      "@type": "prov:Influence",
      "prov:entity": {
        "@id": "source:eagle-4-20260401"
      },
      "prov:influencer": {
        "@id": "source:eagle-4-20260401"
      },
      "provenance:relationshipType": "bundled",
      "provenance:contribution": "The local color-picker comparison uses the installed\n[Eagle (2026)](./REFERENCES.md#eagle-4-20260401) filter template, styles,\nimage assets, and bundled jQuery picker beside Pond's React Aria component.\nExtracted files and their hashes remain in the ignored preview directory\n`apps/desktop/.tmp/color-picker/eagle/`. Only preview event wiring and shell\nplacement are adapted; Eagle's Library filtering is not reproduced. This is a\ncomparison reference, not an adoption of Eagle application code into Pond.\nPond's picker adapts Eagle's 202px popup, 150px color area, vertical hue rail,\n20px swatches, preset hex values, compact hex input, and inline Accuracy control.\nThe design adaptation is credited to Eagle; application UI reuse terms are not\nestablished. Pond retains React Aria behavior and its existing RGB-distance\nfiltering rather than Eagle's jQuery implementation or search engine.",
      "provenance:target": [
        {
          "@id": "target:area%3Ainfluence%2Feagle-parity-baselines"
        }
      ],
      "provenance:confidence": "unknown",
      "prov:generatedAtTime": "2026-09-24"
    },
