      },
      "provenance:relationshipType": "copied",
      "provenance:contribution": "The [September 22 interaction and accessibility audit](eagle-interaction-accessibility-audit-2026-09-22.md)\ncompares current Pond source with a fresh extraction of\n[Eagle (2026)](./REFERENCES.md#eagle-4-20260401). It distinguishes available\noperations from selection, focus, and keyboard completeness. Installed assets\nwere inspected for behavior and interface structure, not copied into Pond;\nEagle's proprietary reuse terms were not established by this audit. Live\nverification remains incomplete because the desktop locked during capture.",
      "provenance:target": [
        {
          "@id": "target:area%3Ainfluence%2Feagle-parity-baselines"
        }
      ],
