      "provenance:relationshipType": "consulted",
      "provenance:contribution": "Pond offers built-in macOS capture and can delegate to installed screenshot tools. The local\nlaunch adapters follow the documented URL schemes from\n[CleanShot (n.d.)](./REFERENCES.md#cleanshot-url-scheme) and\n[Shottr (n.d.)](./REFERENCES.md#shottr-url-scheme). Pond owns watched-folder\nintake, routing, and Library organization after each tool saves its output.",
      "provenance:target": [
