      "provenance:contribution": "- [Free Download Manager (n.d.)](./REFERENCES.md#free-download-manager-screenshots): Keep the queue primary and put selected-transfer metadata in the inspector.\n- [Motrix (n.d.)](./REFERENCES.md#motrix-features): Put state navigation ahead of Source filters and keep progress with its row.\n- [*Como limpar “apagar”, histórico de downloads?* (2024)](./REFERENCES.md#google-chrome-download-history-community): Group durable history by date; preserve search and a file-reveal action.\n- [bezzad (n.d.)](./REFERENCES.md#github-com-bezzad-downloader-desktop): Reveal eligible batch actions after selection and keep failure detail out of the base table.\n- [Aloha Mobile (n.d.)](./REFERENCES.md#aloha-browser-access-downloads): On narrow windows, retain search, status, filenames, and completed-file actions while collapsing surrounding context.",
      "provenance:target": [
