        "@id": "source:vscode-brand"
      },
      "provenance:relationshipType": "copied",
      "provenance:contribution": "The VS Code icon in `apps/desktop/src/renderer/src/assets/logos/agents/vscode.svg` is copied from Microsoft’s official icon download with an accessible SVG title added; the artwork is unchanged and identifies the VS Code MCP setup row ([Microsoft, n.d.-a](./REFERENCES.md#vscode-brand)). Microsoft retains the trademark; use is subject to the linked brand guidelines, not Pond’s MIT license. The upstream notice ships beside the asset as `README.txt`.",
      "provenance:target": [
        {
          "@id": "target:area%3Ainventory%2Fruntime-dependencies"
        }
      ],
      "provenance:confidence": "unknown",
      "prov:generatedAtTime": "2026-09-24"
    },
    {
      "@id": "influence:google-lens-icon-inventory-runtime-dependencies",
      "@type": "prov:Influence",
      "prov:entity": {
        "@id": "source:google-lens-icon"
      },
      "prov:influencer": {
        "@id": "source:google-lens-icon"
      },
      "provenance:relationshipType": "copied",
      "provenance:contribution": "Reverse-image search marks in\n`apps/desktop/src/renderer/src/assets/logos/reverse-search` identify the\nservices that receive a search. The Google Lens logo is copied from\n[Google (2023)](./REFERENCES.md#google-lens-icon). Bing, SauceNAO, TinEye,\nand Yandex marks are PNG conversions of each service's official favicon\n([Bing, n.d.](./REFERENCES.md#bing-favicon);\n[SauceNAO, n.d.](./REFERENCES.md#saucenao-favicon);\n[TinEye, n.d.](./REFERENCES.md#tineye-favicon);\n[Yandex, n.d.](./REFERENCES.md#yandex-favicon)). Google Lens identifies its\nlogo as public-domain geometry subject to trademark restrictions. Usage terms\nfor the four official favicons are not recorded; their trademarks remain with\ntheir owners. Baidu and Sogou open their official image-search surfaces\n([Baidu, n.d.](./REFERENCES.md#graph-baidu-com-pcpage-index);\n[Sogou, n.d.](./REFERENCES.md#pic-sogou-com-ris)) without vendored marks.",
      "provenance:target": [
        {
          "@id": "target:area%3Ainventory%2Fruntime-dependencies"
        }
      ],
      "provenance:confidence": "unknown",
      "prov:generatedAtTime": "2026-09-24"
    },
