      },
      "prov:influencer": {
        "@id": "source:marqo-nsfw-image-detection-384"
      },
      "provenance:relationshipType": "consulted",
      "provenance:contribution": "- **Sensitive content:** Marqo `nsfw-image-detection-384`\n  ([Marqo, 2025b](./REFERENCES.md#marqo-nsfw-image-detection-384)), Apache-2.0.\n  Pond downloads `onnx/model.onnx` from revision\n  `b2d8f0c3abe6e05062288460ecf58e42ea690e84`\n  ([Marqo, 2025a](./REFERENCES.md#marqo-nsfw-image-detection-384-onnx)).\n  The artifact is 22,527,617 bytes with SHA-256\n  `7b81155313d894bba3a3b9bace059a6da2a0c509d10cea43fcb0b3c5a4edd26d`.\n  Input is batched RGB `384×384`, center-cropped and normalized to `[-1, 1]`;\n  output logits are ordered `[NSFW, SFW]`. Pond classifies local images and\n  sampled video frames on-device and stores the maximum NSFW confidence.",
      "provenance:target": [
        {
          "@id": "target:area%3Ainventory%2Fon-device-models"
        }
      ],
      "provenance:confidence": "unknown",
