      "provenance:relationshipType": "adapted",
      "provenance:contribution": "A user-directed inspection of the installed Eagle 4 tag and folder selection\npanels informed Pond's inspector pickers and side-by-side development gallery.\nPond adapts the shared search-focused panel concept, independent logical cursor,\ninset folder-tree rows, a grouped tag grid, compact rows, keyboard legends, and\nellipsized labels. Pond intentionally omits Eagle's folder scope switcher, tag\nsidebar, layout switcher, and pin button so assignment stays focused on one list\nor grid. Pond implements its own Popover-based React PickerPanel primitive,\npreserves explicit mixed selection and path search, uses Nucleo icons and Pond\ndesign tokens, and retains its own mutation and accessibility behavior. For\ndirect comparison, the development-only gallery can route an ignored local\nextraction of Eagle's original picker markup, JavaScript, CSS, and icons into\nisolated iframe surfaces. Those extracted files are not committed, imported by Pond\nproduct code, or included in Pond builds.",
      "provenance:target": [
